Maintainer: Wolfgang Esser-Skala <wolfgang.esser-skala@plus.ac.at>
Description: Genes may be epigenetically primed for activation. 
    This package identifies such genes in a single-cell RNA- and ATAC-seq 
    dataset by comparing chromatin accessibility of each gene promoter 
    to the expression level of the corresponding gene.
